{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2349", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2349/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2349/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2349/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2349", "id": 2405873231, "node_id": "I_kwDOBabE0s6PZrZP", "number": 2349, "title": "Unable to connect", "user": {"login": "Dustcendant", "id": 118822009, "node_id": "U_kgDOBxUUeQ", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/118822009?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant", "html_url": "https://github.com/Dustcendant", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [{"id": 629977272, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw2Mjk5NzcyNzI=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/labels/question", "name": "question", "color": "cc317c", "default": true, "description": null}, {"id": 1457141589, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWwxNDU3MTQxNTg5", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/labels/more_info_needed", "name": "more_info_needed", "color": "db5c93", "default": false, "description": ""}], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 6, "created_at": "2024-07-12T15:34:28Z", "updated_at": "2024-07-16T10:05:22Z", "closed_at": "2024-07-16T10:04:21Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "NONE", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "Hello,\r\nI'm trying to connect a custom flight simulator to the MavSDK using python.\r\nI use MavSDK-python for the control, simply trying to connect via python code:\r\n\r\ndrone = System()\r\nawait drone.connect(system_address=\"__input_addres__\")\r\n\r\nThe simulator has its own server for connection implemented in pymavlink library with which there are no problems. I am able to connect to the custom server using a controller made with pymavlink library.\r\nThe problem is I am unable to establish working connection to the MavSDK, neither via the python wrapper or the server when run from console.\r\nBasically this is the most the most I can get out of the server:\r\n\r\n[04:39:22|Info ] MAVSDK version: v2.12.0 (mavsdk_impl.cpp:26)\r\n[04:39:22|Info ] Waiting to discover system on udp://:14540... (connection_initiator.h:20)\r\n[04:39:24|Debug] New system ID: 255 Comp ID: 0 (mavsdk_impl.cpp:720)\r\n[04:39:29|Info ] heartbeats timed out (system_impl.cpp:265)\r\n\r\nBut funnily enough, it's not like there's nothing I get, when I connect to the server, I'm receiving heartbeat and ping, the server responds to ping and heartbeat.\r\nThis is the code I use as the base for the mavlink server:\r\n\r\nmavConn = mavutil.mavlink_connection('udp:localhost:14540')\r\n\r\nThis code can be used as both the custom server AND the client, it connects, receives messages and also sends without any issue.\r\nAfter the connection is initiated, I send heartbeat and ping, both get response but the mavsdk_server never progresses beyond the third line of the log I copied.\r\nIn code, the function \"connect\" never ends making me believe the mavsdk_server doesn't recognize the connection as valid system.\r\n\r\n\r\nMy question is, what do I have to send to the mavsdk_server for it to recognize my custom server as valid system.\r\n\r\nThank you for the support.", "closed_by": {"login": "Dustcendant", "id": 118822009, "node_id": "U_kgDOBxUUeQ", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/118822009?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant", "html_url": "https://github.com/Dustcendant", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2349/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2349/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null}, "comments": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/2226405809", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2349#issuecomment-2226405809", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2349", "id": 2226405809, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s6EtEGx", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2024-07-12T21:56:51Z", "updated_at": "2024-07-12T21:56:51Z", "body": "What port is your custom thing sending MAVLink to? Or what port is it listening on?", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/2226405809/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/2226533855", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2349#issuecomment-2226533855", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2349", "id": 2226533855, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s6EtjXf", "user": {"login": "Dustcendant", "id": 118822009, "node_id": "U_kgDOBxUUeQ", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/118822009?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant", "html_url": "https://github.com/Dustcendant", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2024-07-12T23:40:12Z", "updated_at": "2024-07-12T23:40:12Z", "body": "> What port is your custom thing sending MAVLink to? Or what port is it listening on?\r\n\r\nI run the custom server on port 14540 by default but tested with different ports too (both IP and port can be set manually to anything via in-app configurator).\r\nEach time the same result, my custom server receives pings and heartbeats, the mavsdk_server responds to both pings and heartbeats but never returns past the connect function.\r\nIt may also be that pings don't return from my custom server?\r\nThough I don't see any ping response neither in pymavlink docs or the library source.\r\nFor the record, pymavlink creates a simple udp socket server from pythons socket library, while MavSDK python wrapper runs precompiled c++ application that creates and manages the server, from what I saw in the source, also simple socket server.", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/2226533855/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/2227495424", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2349#issuecomment-2227495424", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2349", "id": 2227495424, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s6ExOIA", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2024-07-14T22:00:21Z", "updated_at": "2024-07-14T22:00:21Z", "body": "Ok, so presumably your custom server doesn't look enough like an autopilot to MAVSDK.\r\n\r\n```\r\n [04:39:24|Debug] New system ID: 255 Comp ID: 0 (mavsdk_impl.cpp:720)\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis looks like default pymavlink which is wrong in my opinion, or at least doesn't make much sense. The compid of a source can't be 0. (Only the target can be 0 meaning all.)\r\n\r\nYour server needs to have compid 1 to be an autopilot.", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/2227495424/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/2228163323", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2349#issuecomment-2228163323", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2349", "id": 2228163323, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s6EzxL7", "user": {"login": "Dustcendant", "id": 118822009, "node_id": "U_kgDOBxUUeQ", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/118822009?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant", "html_url": "https://github.com/Dustcendant", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2024-07-15T10:19:58Z", "updated_at": "2024-07-15T10:19:58Z", "body": "> Ok, so presumably your custom server doesn't look enough like an autopilot to MAVSDK.\r\n> \r\n> ```\r\n>  [04:39:24|Debug] New system ID: 255 Comp ID: 0 (mavsdk_impl.cpp:720)\r\n> ```\r\n> \r\n> This looks like default pymavlink which is wrong in my opinion, or at least doesn't make much sense. The compid of a source can't be 0. (Only the target can be 0 meaning all.)\r\n> \r\n> Your server needs to have compid 1 to be an autopilot.\r\n\r\nThat did the trick.\r\nBut I cant find much documentation on the component IDs, I presume the IDs are defined somewhere.\r\nCould you please send me a link to anything or point me somewhere I could find it?\r\n\r\nThanks for the help, I'll be closing this issue tomorrow.", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/2228163323/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/2229043244", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2349#issuecomment-2229043244", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2349", "id": 2229043244, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s6E3IAs", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2024-07-15T17:37:37Z", "updated_at": "2024-07-15T17:37:37Z", "body": "The