: "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "event": "labeled", "commit_id": null, "commit_url": null, "created_at": "2024-07-12T21:57:02Z", "label": {"name": "more_info_needed", "color": "db5c93"}, "intent": null, "performed_via_github_app": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/2226533855", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2349#issuecomment-2226533855", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2349", "id": 2226533855, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s6EtjXf", "user": {"login": "Dustcendant", "id": 118822009, "node_id": "U_kgDOBxUUeQ", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/118822009?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant", "html_url": "https://github.com/Dustcendant", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2024-07-12T23:40:12Z", "updated_at": "2024-07-12T23:40:12Z", "body": "> What port is your custom thing sending MAVLink to? Or what port is it listening on?\r\n\r\nI run the custom server on port 14540 by default but tested with different ports too (both IP and port can be set manually to anything via in-app configurator).\r\nEach time the same result, my custom server receives pings and heartbeats, the mavsdk_server responds to both pings and heartbeats but never returns past the connect function.\r\nIt may also be that pings don't return from my custom server?\r\nThough I don't see any ping response neither in pymavlink docs or the library source.\r\nFor the record, pymavlink creates a simple udp socket server from pythons socket library, while MavSDK python wrapper runs precompiled c++ application that creates and manages the server, from what I saw in the source, also simple socket server.", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/2226533855/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null, "event": "commented", "actor": {"login": "Dustcendant", "id": 118822009, "node_id": "U_kgDOBxUUeQ", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/118822009?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant", "html_url": "https://github.com/Dustcendant", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/2227495424", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2349#issuecomment-2227495424", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2349", "id": 2227495424, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s6ExOIA", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2024-07-14T22:00:21Z", "updated_at": "2024-07-14T22:00:21Z", "body": "Ok, so presumably your custom server doesn't look enough like an autopilot to MAVSDK.\r\n\r\n```\r\n [04:39:24|Debug] New system ID: 255 Comp ID: 0 (mavsdk_impl.cpp:720)\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis looks like default pymavlink which is wrong in my opinion, or at least doesn't make much sense. The compid of a source can't be 0. (Only the target can be 0 meaning all.)\r\n\r\nYour server needs to have compid 1 to be an autopilot.", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/2227495424/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null, "event": "commented", "actor": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/2228163323", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2349#issuecomment-2228163323", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2349", "id": 2228163323, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s6EzxL7", "user": {"login": "Dustcendant", "id": 118822009, "node_id": "U_kgDOBxUUeQ", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/118822009?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant", "html_url": "https://github.com/Dustcendant", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2024-07-15T10:19:58Z", "updated_at": "2024-07-15T10:19:58Z", "body": "> Ok, so presumably your custom server doesn't look enough like an autopilot to MAVSDK.\r\n> \r\n> ```\r\n>  [04:39:24|Debug] New system ID: 255 Comp ID: 0 (mavsdk_impl.cpp:720)\r\n> ```\r\n> \r\n> This looks like default pymavlink which is wrong in my opinion, or at least doesn't make much sense. The compid of a source can't be 0. (Only the target can be 0 meaning all.)\r\n> \r\n> Your server needs to have compid 1 to be an autopilot.\r\n\r\nThat did the trick.\r\nBut I cant find much documentation on the component IDs, I presume the IDs are defined somewhere.\r\nCould you please send me a link to anything or point me somewhere I could find it?\r\n\r\nThanks for the help, I'll be closing this issue tomorrow.", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/2228163323/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null, "event": "commented", "actor": {"login": "Dustcendant", "id": 118822009, "node_id": "U_kgDOBxUUeQ", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/118822009?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant", "html_url": "https://github.com/Dustcendant", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dustcendant/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url